n in previous teasers  as well as the memories from breath of  the wild  now i've already seen so many  suggestions floating around about the  possible identity of this mystery person  twin rova agonim the fortune teller  talked about in breath of the wild's  backstory  a twilight a zonai yeah you get the  point  of course until the game actually comes  out these will just remain speculations  just like with master koga  so i'm just gonna give you my prediction  slash theory about this and we can see  how right  or wrong i was when the game comes out  first off i'm gonna save myself the  headache right now and say  i think this person is a woman the eye  shadow and the face  structure definitely seems to hint in  that direction so i'm just gonna call  this figure she  from now on or else i'm gonna have to  constantly switch up my wording which  ruins the flow of the video  there is another reason why i draw this  conclusion it's not just based on  physical appearance but i will explain  that later  but if it turns out that this person is  something else i apologize in advance  for being wrong  aside from the gerudo symbol on the  cloak we can also see that she wears  jewelry on her forehead which seems to  symbolize ganon's malice eye which is  very interesting in and of itself as  we've never seen this symbol before  whoever this person is she seems to know  about ganon's malice form  even though he hasn't been seen for the  last 10 thousand years  and pretty much nobody else seems to  have remembered his existence  so either she is an extremely old entity  or the knowledge about calamity ganon  has been passed on to her  which ties into the question of what is  she exactly  what kind of people or race does she  belong to well if the grudo symbolism on  her cloak wasn't enough  which could of course just be a tribute  but look at the eye color  they are yellow which rays historically  had yellow eyes  the ancient gerudo from the distant past  including ganondorf hi