  powers the guardians and other machinery  you often obtain one after defeating a  guardian stalker  however by default these cores have a  blue and orange glow  this one glows a reddish pink color  meaning it's probably an ancient core  corrupted with malice and what happens  when calamity ganon corrupts something  with malice  he's able to perceive the world through  that being or object  each corrupted machine or malice  infested being is basically a piece of  ganon's conscience  and i think this cloaked figure is using  this corrupted core to communicate with  ganondorf himself  since well if it's corrupted a piece of  his conscience is in there in my video  about ganondorf the puppet master  i suggested that ganondorf had to have  someone to serve as his eyes above  ground  well this is probably that person this  also explains why the yiga knew  exactly what to do during the calamity  despite their incompetence  they were led by this mystery figure who  in turn is receiving instructions from  the man himself  my prediction is that this core was  purposely corrupted at some point to  serve as  almost like a crystal ball to talk to  the king of evil again  very reminiscent of the crystal ball  from lord of the rings which is called a  palantir  and also used to communicate with the  main baddie sauron  the last option i want to cover is does  this mean we'll get a glimpse of  ganondorf in age of calamity  and again i'm not talking about calamity  ganon which as we know by now is just a  puppet  i'm talking about the corpse hidden  underground i was already kind of hoping  this game would tie into or at least  hint at what is to come in breath of the  wild too but prior to this teaser i  never really saw a way they could  achieve something like that but this  changes everything and we might actually  get to see cutscenes where we see this  cloaked figure  talking to the actual ganondorf and if  she doesn't die in the age of calamity  we might actually see her return in  breath of the wild too  it would be a perfect transition into  the sequel whatever the case may be  this game together with breath the wild  and its upcoming sequel is shaping up to  be the biggest zelda canon story  we've ever seen in zelda history and  that makes me  very happy as always a big thanks for  watching and i will see you all  in the next video hopefully a proper one  this time  give me a break nintendo

